      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Continuing his flashback, Chef Barinov recalls how Nagiyev invited Kristina to a romantic dinner that very evening and asked Vika to have another hostess cover her shift. Pulling out a velvet box in the office, Nagiyev announces to Barinov and Vika that he intends to propose to Kristina tonight.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что, поужинаем сегодня?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Ну, я вообще-то на работе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nagiyev",
      "t": "Я договорюсь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "И на вечер замените Кристину.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
